  "@type": "SemioticProjection",
  "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
  "label": "User projected onto the grieving man as the father experiencing the tragedy",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the visual material of the elderly man in distress, who is implicitly mapped as the father in the text's scenario. The text uses 'your wife' and 'you're alone' which directly address the viewer ('you'), creating a deictic projection where the user is positioned as the experiencing subject of the described tragedy. The user is thus projected onto the visual entity 'man' (the grieving man) who embodies the emotional state described in the text.",
